## 🔧 Available Commands
```bash
just setup          # Setup environment
just data           # Prepare data
just data-pipeline  # Run full data pipeline
just train          # Train model
just evaluate       # Evaluate model
just predict        # Make predictions
{% if use_marimo %}just notebook       # Start Marimo notebook{% endif %}
just test           # Run tests
just fix            # Format and fix code
just pipeline       # Run full ML pipeline
```

